      "description": {
        "fun": "The Master Dojo's 'secret armour', a little bear cub that trains body and mind and treats every defeat as motivation. Tugging the long white hair on its head fires up its fighting spirit, and power wells up from deep in its belly. The fighting style it masters decides which kind of Urshifu it grows into.",
        "guide": "A Fighting-type Legendary Pokémon from The Isle of Armor, designed by Yusuke Ohmura. Kubfu evolves into one of two styles of Urshifu depending on which tower's scroll it studies.",
        "tagline": "A kung fu bear cub training for its big decision",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Kubfu (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Kubfu_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "branches": {
        "text": "Which scroll it studies decides. The Scroll of Darkness, at the top of the Tower of Darkness, makes Single Strike Urshifu, a Dark type that wins with one devastating blow; the Scroll of Waters, at the top of the Tower of Waters, makes Rapid Strike Urshifu, a Water type whose strikes flow like a river. Kubfu is the only Pokémon that evolves with a key item.",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Kubfu (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Kubfu_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
