      "description": {
        "fun": "Urshifu fights in one of two styles. Single Strike believes in the one-hit KO, leaping in close and landing one devastating punch with a hardened fist, while Rapid Strike rains down blows that flow like a river. Together they echo the hard and soft sides of Chinese martial arts. It's the only Legendary Pokémon that can Gigantamax, and the only Pokémon with two Gigantamax forms.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Kubfu, a Legendary Pokémon from The Isle of Armor in two styles: Fighting and Dark-type Single Strike and Fighting and Water-type Rapid Strike. Each style has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A martial arts bear with two fighting styles",
